and are typically identified with words such as &ldquo;may,&rdquo; &ldquo;could,&rdquo; &ldquo;should,&rdquo; &ldquo;will,&rdquo; &ldquo;would,&rdquo;
&ldquo;believe,&rdquo; &ldquo;anticipate,&rdquo; &ldquo;estimate,&rdquo; &ldquo;expect,&rdquo; &ldquo;aim,&rdquo; &ldquo;intend,&rdquo;
&ldquo;plan&rdquo; or words or phases of similar meaning and include, without limitation, Steakholder Foods&rsquo; expectations regarding
